<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Happy Birthday, My Love!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(#ffecd2, #fcb69f);
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #ffb3b3;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 2em;
    }
    section {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    img {
      max-width: 90%;
      height: auto;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }
    .timeline {
      text-align: left;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .timeline h3 {
      color: #d94f4f;
    }
    .love-note {
      background: #fff0f0;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
      max-width: 600px;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #555;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>Happy Birthday, My Love 💖</header>

  <section>
    <h2>Our Journey So Far</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <h3>📍 How We Met</h3>
      <p>It all started with a smile and a simple hello...</p>
      <h3>🎉 Our First Date</h3>
      <p>That magical evening I'll never forget.</p>
      <h3>✈️ Our Trip Together</h3>
      <p>Exploring the world with you was a dream come true.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x400?text=Our+Photo" alt="Our memory">
    <div class="love-note">
      "Every moment with you is a gift. On your special day, I just want to say how deeply I love you. Happy Birthday! Here's to many more memories together."
    </div>
    <p><a href="https://forms.gle/yourpuzzlegame" target="_blank">🎁 Click here to start your birthday puzzle!</a></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    Made with love by [Your Name] ❤️
  </footer>
</body>
</html>


